    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Videogame About Guessing Videogames!</h2><br>Chat Guess Games is a community game for Twitch Streamers. A game for your community to battle it out and see who truly knows the most about video games!<br><br>Screenshots, artwork, genres, release year and more are displayed on screen and chat races to guess the correct videogame first!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Rounds can be started with chat commands or with one simple click in-game.</li><li>Autoplay mode where the rounds keep coming, perfect for engaging viewers during brb and starting screens or during community night.</li><li>Community Leaderboards to encourage competition in your community and Top Channel Leaderboards to compete against other channels and see which community is best at game trivia.</li><li>A retro-only category.</li><li>Almost 2,000 games to guess!</li><li>A great way to learn about new games.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523390/extras/50a72d7026b0d3183f6f84b7c040fe39.avif?t=1739354715\" /></span>",
